{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02503","headline":"安德山池宴集 · 杨续","name":"安德山池宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"狭斜通凤阙，上路抵青楼。\n簪绂啓宾馆，轩盖临御沟。\n西城多妙舞，主第出名讴。\n列峰疑宿雾，疏壑拟藏舟。\n花蝶辞风影，苹藻含春流。\n酒阑高宴毕，自反山之幽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨续","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02503.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02503","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}